      "overview": "Reina and Nicolas have the misconception that the other is a wealthy person when they bump into each other at a wedding. In reality, Reina is just a seamstress and Nicolas is a valet parking employee. Victor, Reina’s future husband, plans his revenge for Nicolas who allegedly his daughter.",
