      "overview": "Eight years later, Reina discovers that Nicolas is not dead. Nicolas takes up a new identity in order to take his revenge out with Victor over his unjust accusation over the death of Victor’s daughter. After her car accident, Reina forgets all recollection of her past and is force to trust Victor and believe that the daughter she is about to have is Victor’s child and not Nicolas.",
